# Test Requests for Cat API

### GET cats
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats

### GET cat by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/1

### POST new cat
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rolle",
    "birthdate": "2022-10-10",
    "weight": 4,
    "owner": "Tiina",
    "image": "https://placecats.com/310/240"
}